Title: Lucy meets Lenny
Credit: Written by
Source: David Joyner
Draft date: 2026/03/28
Version: 0.9.0

[[
KIND: Lucy | slender stick-figure, rose-red edges, smooth vertices, athletic build
]]

[[
KIND: Lenny | broad stick-figure, blue edges, wider shoulders, heavier build
]]

[[
KIND: Dog | four-legged talking dog, silver-grey body, trotting at heel,
side-view silhouette, articulated joints, compact and energetic
]]


INT. VOID - DAY

[[ MOOD: clean white void, graphic, minimal, high-contrast stick-figure animation ]]
[[ SCENE POPULATION: Lucy, Ramis (dog). Lenny enters later. ]]
[[ NEGATIVE: No background. No scenery. No shading. Stick figures only. ]]

LUCY [Lucy], a slender figure with rose-red edges, jogs in from the left.

RAMIS [Dog], a compact robot dog with silver-grey joints, trots alongside Lucy.

[[ SCENE POPULATION: Lucy and Ramis present. Lenny not yet visible. ]]
[[ CAMERA: Wide shot. Lucy and Ramis enter from screen-left, moving right. ]]

LENNY [Lenny], a broader figure with blue edges, stands to the right.

[[ SCENE POPULATION: Lucy, Ramis, and Lenny. ]]
[[ CAMERA: Medium two-shot. Lucy and Lenny face each other. Ramis at Lucy's heel. ]]

LUCY
Hey, who are you?

LENNY
I'm Lenny. You?

LUCY
Lucy. Nice edges!

LENNY
Thanks, smooth vertices!

[[ CAMERA: Wide shot. All three present. ]]

LENNY
What's your dog's name?

LUCY
Meet Ramis.

Ramis wags his tail and sits.

RAMIS
Woof!

[[ SCENE POPULATION: Lucy, Lenny, and Ramis. ]]
[[ CAMERA: Medium shot. Lucy and Lenny face each other. Ramis between them. ]]

Lucy waves.

Lenny waves.

Lucy and Lenny walk toward each other.

RAMIS
Yap!

LUCY
Let's sit together.

[[ CAMERA: Medium two-shot. Lucy and Lenny seated. Ramis stands nearby. ]]

Lucy sits down.

LENNY
I hope there are *two* chairs!

Lenny sits down.

Lucy stands up.

Lenny stands up.

LUCY
Race you to the right!

LENNY
Hey, wait for me!

[[ CAMERA: Wide shot. All three running right. ]]
[[ SCENE POPULATION: Lucy, Lenny, and Ramis racing right. ]]

Lucy and Lenny run to the right. Ramis runs alongside Lucy.

Lucy finishes first.

LUCY
I won!

RAMIS
Ruff!

Lenny catches up.

LENNY
I think I'm in love.

[[ CAMERA: Medium shot. Hold on Lenny's face. ]]
